.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt MIDNIGHTBSD-OPEN-FOLDER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm midnightbsd-open-folder
.Nd open local folders in Midnight Workspace
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar folder-or-file-URI ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends the specified local folders to the running Midnight Workspace over
the session D-Bus and opens them in its built-in file manager.
Arguments may be local paths or
.Pa file://
URIs.
With no arguments, it opens the home directory.
Remote URIs and folders that do not exist are rejected.
It does not start a new window manager session.
.Pp
The installed
.Pa org.midnightbsd.Workspace.Files.desktop
entry associates this command with
.Pa inode/directory .
Select Midnight Workspace Files in the Application defaults page of
.Xr midnightbsd-settings 1
to make it the default folder handler.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS
Select the session bus used to contact the running workspace.
.It Ev HOME
Select the folder opened when no argument is supplied.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr midnight-wm 1 ,
.Xr midnightbsd-settings 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Lucas Holt
